              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with farm implements and rocks (count as hand weapons/javelins with a 4" range). May have spear tipped halberds (+2 pts). Warband Rule 1. Light Infantry. Simple Minded. No Flags, No Trumpets. Looting. (The Art of War p.110)</characteristic>
