  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="58f6-b82c-579b-d2e0" name="Han Dynasty: Red Eyebrows Rebels (Art of War) - List Notes" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false">
      <description>RED EYEBROWS REBELS (The Art of War, pp.109-111). Special rules: Looting (a unit with this ability can take the shields and weapons of a better equipped enemy if it catches and destroys them in a pursuit or close combat; lost if the unit flees), No Flags, No Trumpets (no banners or musicians, so no combat bonus modifications or Musician roll-off), Simple Minded (the unit must take a Leadership test whenever it wishes to charge; on a failure it stays where it is; subject to the rules for Stubborn if formed). Fear of horses: a Mob successfully charged by cavalry, chariots, elephants, camels, war wagons etc. must take a Fear test. Percentage limits are by points. "May only have one selected option per 1,000 points" for Special Units is documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Red Eyebrows Rebels]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Infantry: at least 33%
  Special Units: up to 25%
  HAN DYNASTY REBEL ARMY - RED EYEBROWS (HONGSEDE MEIMAO). Characters up to 25%. Infantry at least 33% and must include at least one Mob per 1,000 points. Special Units up to 25% (one selected option per 1,000 points).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
